# Secrets

- Never commit `.env`, keystores, `.p8`, `.jks`, service-account JSON, or real API tokens
- Use `.env.example` for public variable names only
- Production: Wrangler secrets / CI secrets / local gitignored files under `secrets/`
- Do not embed private keys in LDP client bundles; only `PUBLIC_*` may ship to the browser
